{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.luca.broken",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她跟着跑完了一整天的电视台",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.luca.broken",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.luca.broken",
    "idolId": "luca",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "一天跑了三家电视台。每一家都说「有机会一定」，然后把人送到电梯口。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……今天辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "回去。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊，嗯。下周同一时间，要是能再来一趟的话────",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "text": "她的手机从手里滑下去，落在瓷砖上，屏幕朝下。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……手机掉了。喂，屏幕是不是摔裂了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "……没什么。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "以前就……裂着了。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，是这样吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "在哪里掉过一次，那时候裂的。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "在哪里……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "河边能看见水的咖啡馆────……发呆来着。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "手机响了……不知道是谁打来的……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "不对……其实……是在等电话。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "像个傻子吧。……结果，还是黄了。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "等的那个，和响的那个，不一样……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "大概是那时候掉的……然后裂了────────",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "保护壳……？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不一定是壳，保护膜之类的也行……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "…………谁知道。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "…………为什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "也不是说非要换新的……修一下用起来方便吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "修……太麻烦了……",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "修好了也一样会裂……",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "可是……",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "luca",
        "text": "不关你的事……",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "text": "她把手机塞回口袋，走了。电梯口的灯一直亮着。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
